{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Notice:This demo is designed and tested only on Windows 10, and other operating systems may have problems. In addition, if your computer uses AMD main window, there will be a black screen problem, but it will not affect the game.It is best to turn off the frame rate display, turn off the steam overlay.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Follow my voice. Trust my guidance.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Do you want to see our god? My friend, you\u2019ve come to the right place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591310/extras/smile.gif?t=1743774633\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I am merely a messenger, and I invite you to step onto the path of salvation. Just follow my lead. At the end of your journey, <strong>our gracious god will be waiting\u2014behind The Window 8.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591310/extras/QQ20250327-212323.png?t=1743774633\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this show, you are no longer the bystanders, you are the star!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591310/extras/pot.gif?t=1743774633\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Oh, and as a welcome gift, we\u2019ve got a little something for you. A game we all love\u2014<strong>Symphony of Pots and Pans.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019ll enjoy it. <strong>You have to.</strong> After all, no one else will welcome you like we do. No one else will treat you like family.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591310/extras/QQ20250313-213235.png?t=1743774633\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And we also have a little dinosaur. It runs and runs and runs...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Please ignore that last part. It\u2019s just a bug in the program. Nothing more. Nothing... intentional.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591310/extras/len.gif?t=1743774633\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Of course, as a member of our team, you also need to complete some tasks, such as finding out the ghosts in the photos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Don't worry, our group will provide reliable props for new members. And there will be absolutely no bloody things in the photos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591310/extras/ff47fc98ecfe4ef08d2a9d886f764c41.png?t=1743774633\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Add it to your wishlist!Add it to your wishlist!Add it to your wishlist!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3591310?t=1743774633","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3591310?t=1743774633","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591310/4502280eac6059730f81388d3e511f587de9ce28/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743774633","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591310/4502280eac6059730f81388d3e511f587de9ce28/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743774633","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"The game contains bloody objects such as mutilated corpses, heads, etc."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Notice:This demo is designed and tested only on Windows 10, and other operating systems may have problems. In addition, if your computer uses AMD main window, there will be a black screen problem, but it will not affect the game.It is best to turn off the frame rate display, turn off the steam overlay.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Follow my voice. Trust my guidance.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Do you want to see our god? My friend, you\u2019ve come to the right place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591310/extras/smile.gif?t=1743774633\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I am merely a messenger, and I invite you to step onto the path of salvation. Just follow my lead. At the end of your journey, <strong>our gracious god will be waiting\u2014behind The Window 8.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591310/extras/QQ20250327-212323.png?t=1743774633\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this show, you are no longer the bystanders, you are the star!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591310/extras/pot.gif?t=1743774633\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Oh, and as a welcome gift, we\u2019ve got a little something for you. A game we all love\u2014<strong>Symphony of Pots and Pans.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019ll enjoy it. <strong>You have to.</strong> After all, no one else will welcome you like we do. No one else will treat you like family.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591310/extras/QQ20250313-213235.png?t=1743774633\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And we also have a little dinosaur. It runs and runs and runs...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Please ignore that last part. It\u2019s just a bug in the program. Nothing more. Nothing... intentional.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591310/extras/len.gif?t=1743774633\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Of course, as a member of our team, you also need to complete some tasks, such as finding out the ghosts in the photos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Don't worry, our group will provide reliable props for new members. And there will be absolutely no bloody things in the photos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591310/extras/ff47fc98ecfe4ef08d2a9d886f764c41.png?t=1743774633\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Add it to your wishlist!Add it to your wishlist!Add it to your wishlist!</p>","developers":["MonsterMoonLight"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3296450","name":"The Window 8"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591310/ca5743e83706e5948d8e960bf496f0fff867fad7/header.jpg?t=1743774633","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257118586,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257118586/movie480.mp4?t=1743732037","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257118586/movie_max.mp4?t=1743732037"},"name":"Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257118586/c562cae2f2b9240b8305f930f3b6ff01b1ae947a/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1743732037","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257118586/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1743732037","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257118586/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1743732037"}},{"highlight":true,"id":257122193,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257122193/movie480.mp4?t=1743774632","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257122193/movie_max.mp4?t=1743774632"},"name":"PV1","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257122193/5